    },
    "MoveTruckRequest": {
      "description": "Move one trip's horse tracker. Writes Pulsit mock state only.\n\nExactly one input mode is accepted:\n  - `waypoint_id` (legacy): one of the fixed Cape Town demo locations in\n    demo_waypoints.py. Ignores the trip's real stops entirely.\n  - `scenario` + `trip_stop_id`: stage a position computed relative to one of\n    THIS trip's actual stops. `trip_stop_id` is required for every scenario\n    except `no_signal` (the tracker going dark is not a coordinate, so there is\n    nothing to offset from a stop; naming a stop for it is optional context).\n\nBoth set, or neither set, is a 422 (`_validate_exactly_one_mode` below) — a\nrequest that could mean two things is treated the same as one that means\nnothing. Arbitrary coordinates are never accepted from the browser in either\nmode: a waypoint id and a scenario id are both closed, server-defined vocabularies.",
      "properties": {
        "scenario": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "at_stop",
                "inside_tolerance",
                "outside_tolerance",
                "three_km",
                "fifty_km",
                "no_signal"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Scenario"
        },
        "trip_id": {
          "format": "uuid",
          "title": "Trip Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "trip_stop_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "uuid",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Trip Stop Id"
        },
        "waypoint_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Waypoint Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "trip_id"
      ],
      "title": "MoveTruckRequest",
